  "reasoning": "The defendant, while holding a position as a comprehensive assistant at a state-owned farm, falsely claimed he could lease land for farmers and deceived multiple victims of cash totaling 178,600 yuan. This conduct fits the statutory definition of fraud (诈骗罪) – using false statements to obtain private property for personal gain. There is no indication of misuse of entrusted authority to appropriate property without deception, so the appropriate charge is fraud alone.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]诈骗<eoa>"
}
